  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Health and Community Systems for a better performance of the three Global Fund targeted programmes. - Burundi (01-Jan-2022-31-Dec-2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Burundi, RSSH, Ministry of Public Health and Fight against AIDS of the Republic of Burundi (MoH Burundi)This program has the following goals: Contribuer  &#xe0; l&apos;amelioration de la disponiblit&#xe9; , de l&apos;accessibilit&#xe9; des soins et des services de sant&#xe9;.  To contribute to the improvement of the availability and accessibility of health care and services.. The objectives of this program are: Am&#xe9;liorer la qualit&#xe9; et la disponibilit&#xe9; des donn&#xe9;es de routine en assurant que 95% des &#xe9;tablissements de sant&#xe9; rapportent leurs donn&#xe9;es dans le syst&#xe8;me national d&apos;informations sanitaires d&apos;ici fin 2023.  Improve the quality and availability of routine data by ensuring that 95% of health facility report routine data through the national HMIS by end of 2023.  Am&#xe9;liorer la qualit&#xe9; des services laboratoires en initiant 173 laboratoires dans le processus d&apos;assurance qualit&#xe9; d&apos;ici fin 2023.  Improve the quality of lab services by initiating 173 laboratories in the quality assurance process by end of 2023</narrative>
  </description>
